* PWR5 (Power page 4 + Main page 2): +5V_24 and module +5V during module start-up and coil switching
.include models.inc
Vu1 u1 0 5.0                                  ; U1 URB2405S-6WR3 output, regulated
Ru1 u1 v5_24 0.1                              ; worst-case load regulation
C6  v5_24 0 15u Rser=5m                       ; 22 uF 25 V at 5 V bias
C7  v5_24 0 100n Rser=20m
Rf2 v5_24 f2 0.12                             ; F2 Littelfuse 1206L110 (cold)
Lfb1 f2 v5 0.5u Rser=30m                      ; FB1 BLM21PG121SN1D (low-frequency model)
Rfb1 f2 v5 120
C8  v5 0 7u Rser=5m                           ; 10 uF 25 V at 5 V
C9  v5 0 100n Rser=20m
Cmod v5 0 7u Rser=5m                          ; module input cap (10 uF 25 V on the MES4-MCU)
Dmod 0 v5 SMF6V0                              ; module SMF6.0A
Bmod v5 0 I=0.04 + 0.20*limit((time-2m)/10u,0,1)  ; module 40 mA, then a 240 mA worst-case step at 2 ms
Rlc v5 0 390                                  ; load-cell excitation, 2 x 780 ohm (via FB2)
* relay + winch coils on +5V_24: 4 x SRD (70 ohm) + 1 x IM03GR (178 ohm) switched on together at 5 ms
Lk  v5_24 kc 0.037 Rser=15.9                  ; 5 coils in parallel: 70||70||70||70||178 = 15.9 ohm, 0.2||..||0.1 H
Sk  kc 0 g 0 SWK
Vg g 0 PULSE(0 1 5m 1u 1u 5m 20m)
.model SWK SW(Ron=50m Roff=100Meg Vt=0.5 Vh=0)
Dk  kc v5_24 D1N4148W
.tran 0 14m 0 50n
.options plotwinsize=0
.save V(v5_24) V(v5) I(Lk)
.meas tran V5_min  MIN V(v5) FROM 1m TO 14m
.meas tran V5_max  MAX V(v5) FROM 1m TO 14m
.meas tran V524_min MIN V(v5_24) FROM 1m TO 14m
.meas tran Icoil   FIND I(Lk) AT 9.9m
.end
